@startuml ServiceLayerClassDiagram

title Тёплый дом - диаграмма классов компонента Device Service Layer

class DeviceService {
  + createDevice()
  + updateDevice()
  + getDevice()
  + listDevices()
  + deleteDevice()
}

class LocationService {
  + createLocation()
  + updateLocation()
  + getLocation()
  + listLocations()
  + deleteLocation()
}

class Device {
  + int id
  + string name
  + DeviceType type
  + DeviceStatus status
}

class Location {
  + int id
  + string name
  + string coordinates
  + List<Device> devices
  + addDevice()
  + removeDevice()
}

class DeviceFilter {
  + int locationId
  + DeviceType type
}

DeviceService --> Device : manages
DeviceService --> DeviceFilter : uses
LocationService --> Location : manages

Location "1" -- "0..*" Device : has

@enduml